            },
            {
                Name: "OC Kayden",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Cry: 1,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

    With a sigh, you roll your eyes, amused by his dramatic hesitation, and urge the boy to just pick something. After a long internal struggle between his hunger and finding the perfect show to watch, he finally chooses a lively cartoon that catches his eye, though you are pretty sure he passed by this show twice already. <span style="Color: LightGreen">Regardless, he seems happy and quickly dives back into his snacks, stuffing his cheeks. <br>
    <br>
    He even offers you a couple bites. What a kind lad.</span>  <br>
    <<socialChange "Kayden" 3 1>>
    <<needChange "Fun" 5>>
    <span style="color:green">+Kayden Fun</span><br>
    <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
    <span style="color:green">+Kayden Energy</span><br>
