    [[Continue|OC Miller House Living Room]] 

<<elseif _random == 3>>
    After a bit, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> decides to move positions and shifts to the plush couch, the fabric soft against his skin as he sprawls out all over it. <span style="Color: LightGreen">He eventually requests, pleading with some big puppy dog eyes, for you to make some popcorn.</span> You eventually relent, but make him promise to share it with you, though you get the feeling he’ll be munching down most of it. You return with a large bowl of buttery popcorn, which <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span>s rests firmly on his lap, the mouthwatering smell filling the air. <span style="Color: LightGreen">He then, somehow, manages to coax you into putting on a <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“totally not scary movie”</span> which looks pretty scary based off the cover.</span> <br>
    <br>
    At first, the film seems like a classic comedy, with the characters chatting in an animated and light fashion as cheerful background music sets a playful tone. You are both laughing at some of the silly antics. The atmosphere is relaxed and cozy and you wonder why the cover looked so scary when the movie seems so light-hearted. <span style="Color: LightCoral">But then, without warning, the screen erupts in a sudden loud noise, accompanied by a horrific image that sends chills down your spine. <br>
    <br>
    <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span>’s reaction is instant, as he lets out a high-pitched scream and nearly launches the bowl of popcorn in the air, causing kernels to scatter across the couch. His wide gray eyes are glued to the screen in shock and, in a frantic motion, he snatches a nearby pillow and shields his face with it in utter terror!</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
